      "start_time": 49.255,
      "end_time": 50.315
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyway, yeah, I just had a really good call with Skyview and Unit nine.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 50.615,
      "end_time": 58.155
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, great.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 58.855,
      "end_time": 59.983
    },
    {
      "text": "Which is great.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 60.159,
      "end_time": 61.063
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 61.159,
      "end_time": 61.887
    },
    {
      "text": "Actually, maybe Even so, unit nine, great opportunity.",
