      "start_time": 70.095,
      "end_time": 71.715
    },
    {
      "text": "33 million six months ago and they didn't take it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 72.615,
      "end_time": 78.155
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, they wanted more money up front and in the last six months they've absolutely it and they lost 3 million.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 78.595,
      "end_time": 87.947
    },
    {
      "text": "So if they'd have taken the money when we offered them, they'd all be on holiday again.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 88.131,
      "end_time": 94.895
    },
    {
      "text": "Unit nine.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 96.635,
      "end_time": 97.331
    },
    {
      "text": "Is the, Is it the Italian guy, if I remember?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 97.363,
      "end_time": 100.315
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, that's him.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 100.475,
      "end_time": 101.435
    },
    {
      "text": "Piero Pierre.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 101.475,
      "end_time": 103.815
    },
    {
      "text": "Possible lost tons of money and so we're now trying to put another offer on the table for him and he's kind of saying, I don't really want it unless you can give us money up front.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 104.835,
      "end_time": 116.345
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're saying.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 117.365,
      "end_time": 118.053
    },
    {
      "text": "Hang on.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 118.109,
      "end_time": 118.437
    },
    {
      "text": "So if we'd have given you the money six months ago, we'd have been in big trouble because you were trying.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 118.461,
      "end_time": 122.573
    },
    {
      "text": "To get more cash?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 122.589,
      "end_time": 124.345
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 125.765,
      "end_time": 126.181
    },
    {
      "text": "So just.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 126.213,
      "end_time": 126.749
    },
    {
      "text": "It was a weird call.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 126.797,
      "end_time": 127.861
    },
    {
      "text": "But the good thing is we now get them off the list.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 127.893,
      "end_time": 129.941
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, we're still going to make them an offer, but we'll, we'll be able to find better companies now that are more profitable and better for us because we'll get a bigger fee.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 130.053,
      "end_time": 139.315
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, exactly is the most important thing.",
