      "start_time": 140.055,
      "end_time": 144.675
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 145.375,
      "end_time": 146.115
    },
    {
      "text": "How are we dealing with shams?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 147.095,
      "end_time": 150.115
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I mean we, we did give him the task and I, I think I did send, I sent him an email with the list.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 152.215,
      "end_time": 160.077
    },
    {
      "text": "So he was going to get back to you with, with a quote and ETA for the, for the project.",
