      "start_time": 160.141,
      "end_time": 166.317
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'm not sure if he sends you back an email.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 166.501,
      "end_time": 169.789
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, he said, he said this is the, the quote.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 169.877,
      "end_time": 175.189
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it was 150 for 15 hours work.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 175.237,
      "end_time": 180.173
    },
    {
      "text": "So you can get started with him now and just see what he comes up with.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 180.229,
      "end_time": 189.935
    },
    {
      "text": "I guess it's going to take him two days.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 189.975,
      "end_time": 191.675
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I'm just going to follow on him tomorrow.",
