      "end_time": 380.195
    },
    {
      "text": "I think Jack resolved that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 380.235,
      "end_time": 381.563
    },
    {
      "text": "So if that comes, then I'll be able to send that as well in the next week.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 381.619,
      "end_time": 386.815
    },
    {
      "text": "So I think that's.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 387.515,
      "end_time": 388.763
    },
    {
      "text": "That's pretty much it from my side.",
